@startuml

salt
{
  <b>SHAPE THE BOOK STRUCTURE</b> | Northwind Capital Ltd  ·  RATES.EUR  ·  EUR_SWAPS_01
  --
  {
    {#
      <b>STEPS</b>
      (1) Book tree
      (2) Choose the portfolio
      (3) Create or open the book
      <b>(4) Set its classification</b>
      (5) Set the rights
      (6) Review
      (7) Outcome
      [ Refused ]  [ History ]
    } | {
      <b>Set its classification</b>  ·  this tenant's data
      Each picker names one row of a shared list. The list itself is not this tenant's.
      --
      {#
        Field | Value | Source
        Status | ^Active^ | shared list
        Regulatory book type | ^Trading^ | shared list
        Book purpose type | ^Trading^ | shared list, no wire field
        Ledger feed type | ^Automatic^ | shared list, no wire field
        Rates centre | ^GBLO^ | business centres
        Sweepable | [x] | this tenant
      }
      --
      <b>Status transition check</b>
      {#
        Transition | Rule
        Active to Frozen | allowed
        Active to Closed | refused while the book holds open activity
        Frozen to Closed | refused, return it to Active first
        Closed to any | refused, terminal
      }
      --
      [ Review the write ]
    }
  }
  --
  {
    <b>Book tree</b> | portfolios and the books under them
    --
    {#
      Portfolio | Purpose | Books
      Global Trading | Risk | 2
      Global Rates | Risk | 4
      EUR Rates | Risk | 2
      USD Rates | Risk | 3
      APAC Credit | Regulatory | 1
    }
    --
    {#
      Book | Status | Purpose | Open activity
      EUR_SWAPS_01 | Active | Trading | 14
      EUR_VOL_01 | Active | Trading | 3
      RESERVE_01 | Frozen | Reserve | none
    }
    --
    [ New book ]  [ Search ]
  } | {
    <b>Direct rights at EUR Rates</b>  ·  this tenant's data
    A right at a node covers every node below it, and not its siblings.
    --
    {#
      Account | read | open_sandbox
      tenant_admin | [x] | [x]
      j.smith | [ ] | [ ]
      a.tanaka | [x] | [ ]
      m.okafor | [x] | [ ]
    }
    --
    <b>Effective rights</b>
    {#
      Account | read | open_sandbox
      a.tanaka | inherited from RATES | direct at RATES
      m.okafor | no right | no right
    }
    --
    [ Review the write ]
  }
  --
  <b>Review</b> | nothing is written until you confirm
  {#
    Change | From | To | Write
    Set ledger feed type | None | Automatic | books.put
    Set rates centre | WRLD | GBLO | books.put
    Grant read to a.tanaka | - | at RATES.EUR | portfolio_rights.put_many
  }
  --
  <b>Shared taxonomy</b> | the system tenant's lists, read only here
  {#
    List | Values
    Book statuses | Active, Closed, Frozen
    Book purpose types | Trading, Reserve, Funding, Wash, WriteOff, Test, Sales, SweepTarget, RemittanceTarget
    Ledger feed types | None, Automatic, Manual
    Regulatory book types | Trading, Banking
    Purpose types | Risk, Regulatory, ClientReporting, Internal
  }
  --
  <b>Refused</b> | the server returns an error
  Book EUR_SWAPS_01 cannot move from Active to Closed: the ledger still shows 14 open trades against it.
  [ Back to the classification ]  [ History ]
  --
  <b>History</b> | version 3 of EUR_SWAPS_01, with the field diff from version 2
  {#
    Version | Changed by | Reason
    <b>3</b> | a.tanaka | book classification changed
    (2) | j.smith | book classification changed
    (1) | system | new record
  }
  [ Revert this version ]
}

@enduml
